			<div class="content" id="post-content-3690498">
									

<p>My first SCP posted on the mainlist! Let's GO!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Thanks&nbsp;to</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jabyrwock" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2300057); return false;">jabyrwock</a></span> for their revisions!<br />
<span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;">DrChandra</a></span> for their review!<br />
<span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3129691); return false;">Modern_Erasmus</a></span> for their input on the initial concept!<br />
<span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3122708); return false;">The Great Hippo</a></span> for their essay on LAUGH IS FUN and how to write a truly unsettling SCP.<br />
<span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hydrozen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2976054); return false;">hydrozen</a></span> for their input!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Where&nbsp;did&nbsp;this&nbsp;come&nbsp;from?</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>My inspiration is 80% music. Music is my life. This article came from listening to <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzhNdCxhK28">&quot;Mr. November&quot;</a> by The National. I fixated on the name of the song and thought it would make a good name for a skip.</p>
<p>The meat of the article was heavily inspired by The Great Hippo's essay as well as my tremendous fandom of Doctor Who. I tried for an overall &quot;Whovian&quot; tone of creepy curiosity and an entity that isn't <em>particularly</em> evil or whatever. It just needs attention.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>The image is <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:John_Marchione_(19280364441).jpg">CC compliant</a> and was found through Wikimedia Commons. One problem though: it's John Marchione, the mayor of Redmond Washington. That might be an issue I don't know.</p>

